# Allosaurus Shepherd's "Green spells you control can't be countered" is
# ValidSA$ Spell.Green+YouCtrl: YouCtrl is the host's controller (ai), so
# human's green Grizzly Bears is still countered.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 8 U
tapformana ai 9 U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 10
resolvestack
